-- CIDM-8676 - Data Cleanup- Multiple open-ended service logs data cleanup
/*
Multiple open-ended service logs data cleanup

Issue: CJAMS application is currently not allowing the users to end date those due to 
	   the duplicate/overlapping validation in place. (CDM-35151 - Service log enhancement) 

	   If the system is having multiple open-ended service logs for the same client, provider, service.

Fix: Data cleanup
	Keep the most recent service log open and all the prior service logs end date 
	with the max end date from the associated purchase authorization.
	
	If there is no associated purchase authorization found, update the end date as service log start date.
	
	And for the closed service case, end date all open service logs.
*/

update tb_service_log set end_dt = '2021-05-01', end_service_reason_cd = (case when end_service_reason_cd is null or btrim(end_service_reason_cd) = '' then '1824' else end_service_reason_cd end), update_ts = now(), update_user_id = 'CIDM-8676' where service_log_id = 938541 and delete_sw = 'N' and end_dt is null ; 
